            "Description": "Predatory Marriage UK is a campaign to reform marriage laws and procedures to protect people with dementia. It aims to change the law such that a marriage does not automatically revoke a Will and to create an offence of 'predatory marriage' to protect people who do not have mental capacity to marry. The campaign was previously called justiceforjoan.com. It was founded by the daughter of Joan Blass, a woman who had severe vascular dementia who was married (aged 91) by a much younger man without her family's knowledge despite lacking the mental capacity to marry.",
